00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:41.580
Rob Elliott, the county's Commissioner of Engineering, planning an environment, told

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:46.060
County Council on Tuesday that staff understand the town not wanting to be the only place

00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:50.060
that takes this, and that the notice has not left enough time to line up other homes.

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:53.560
The county operates six landfill sites with collection systems.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.300
Five have long been hauled to the Collingwood landfill under an existing agreement and a

00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:03.280
force main connection. Oro's load used to go to Berry. After Berry said it could no longer

00:01:03.280 --> 00:01:07.660
treat it, trucks brought it to Collingwood under an agreement caped at 13 liters a second

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:13.060
into that force main. Eliot set aside outside the county has been found at considerable cost

00:01:13.060 --> 00:01:16.880
and that the new hauling and treatment bill is what drives that yearly increase,

00:01:17.140 --> 00:01:22.060
along with extra trucking impacts and less revenue for the town. He said few plants are big enough

00:01:22.060 --> 00:01:27.380
