00:01:41.940 --> 00:01:47.360
closing, and once caped, should produce less leachate and less contamination in it, and that the

00:01:47.360 --> 00:01:52.240
county does not expect volumes to grow. Council backed a second letter asking the town to keep

00:01:52.240 --> 00:01:56.640
accepting oral leachate for at least one year while longer term disposal is lined up.

