00:03:29.423 --> 00:03:33.963
Gray County's three long-term care homes filed 18 critical incident reports with the province

00:03:33.963 --> 00:03:39.223
between August 15th and October 14th. The Owen Sound Current reports from the County's own

00:03:39.223 --> 00:03:44.923
long-term care committee of management. Improper care reports rose from 4 to 15 in a year across

00:03:44.923 --> 00:03:50.263
gray gables in Markdale, Lee Manor in Owen Sound, and Rockwood Terrace in Durham. Those

00:03:50.263 --> 00:03:55.063
numbers are one combined total. The committee paper does not say which home filed which report,

00:03:55.423 --> 00:04:00.123
and it does not describe any single incident. Five of the eighteen sit an abuse and neglect,

00:04:00.563 --> 00:04:06.063
meaning any alleged, suspected, or witness abuse of a resident by anyone, or neglect by the home

00:04:06.063 --> 00:04:11.483
or its staff. Two involve improper or incompetent treatment that caused harm or a risk of harm.

00:04:11.483 --> 00:04:14.283
4 residents went to hospital because of an injury.

00:04:14.883 --> 00:04:17.343
2 medication incidents sent a resident to hospital.

00:04:17.823 --> 00:04:20.883
1 controlled substance was reported missing or unaccounted for.

00:04:21.243 --> 00:04:23.643
The homes also reported 4 disease outbreaks.

00:04:24.163 --> 00:04:26.803
The committee got the paper for information on November 10.

00:04:27.183 --> 00:04:30.963
Staff did not walk through the incident table and no member asked about it.

00:04:31.283 --> 00:04:34.783
The report says the incidents have been reviewed and internally investigated

00:04:34.783 --> 00:04:39.183
and that action plans are in place along with extra training and education as required.

00:04:39.183 --> 00:04:45.263
Ministry of long-term care inspectors were in all three homes in September, and issued seven written notices.

00:04:45.763 --> 00:04:48.883
A written notice means inspectors found a requirement was not met.

00:04:49.463 --> 00:04:55.223
Lee Manor received three notices after a critical incident inspection from September 15th to the 24th.

00:04:55.523 --> 00:04:59.623
On duty to report, general requirements and altercations between residents.

00:05:00.143 --> 00:05:05.923
