00:05:18.803 --> 00:05:22.443
In each case, the report says staff followed up and the issues have been addressed.

00:05:23.123 --> 00:05:25.723
Terry Fisher, executive director of Rockwood Terrace,

00:05:26.083 --> 00:05:30.743
